1
00:00:23,776 --> 00:00:28,515
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,515 --> 00:00:32,227
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,451 --> 00:00:34,696
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:35,043 --> 00:00:37,750
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,629 --> 00:00:43,157
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:43,157 --> 00:00:46,789
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,267 --> 00:00:50,755
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:52,899 --> 00:00:55,395
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,395 --> 00:01:00,035
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,423 --> 00:01:02,083
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:02,083 --> 00:01:08,035
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,227 --> 00:01:11,915
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:11,915 --> 00:01:15,486
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,651 --> 00:01:22,595
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:23,043 --> 00:01:26,664
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,664 --> 00:01:30,348
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,435 --> 00:01:35,363
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,363 --> 00:01:39,523
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,267 --> 00:01:46,819
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,363 --> 00:01:50,019
=Episode 19=

21
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:53,480
Stop!

22
00:01:53,959 --> 00:01:55,359
Governor, go!

23
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:56,879
What happened?

24
00:01:57,519 --> 00:01:59,400
Xu Fan has retaken the Governor Mansion.

25
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:00,680
I fought while retreating,

26
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:03,439
and now the pursuers are not far behind.

27
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:04,920
There's no time.

28
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,359
Governor, go now!

29
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,599
What are you doing?

30
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:10,960
Governor, just leave me behind.

31
00:02:14,199 --> 00:02:15,000
Yongnian!

32
00:02:15,319 --> 00:02:17,199
I enlisted as a youth

33
00:02:17,599 --> 00:02:19,560
and fought
over a dozen battles with you.

34
00:02:20,039 --> 00:02:23,400
You've saved me
more times than I can count.

35
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:26,439
Saving you now is worth it all.

36
00:02:28,479 --> 00:02:29,280
Yongnian.

37
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:33,919
Yongnian!

38
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:36,319
Open the door!

39
00:02:37,759 --> 00:02:38,800
Go now!

40
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:48,360
Yongnian!

41
00:03:16,919 --> 00:03:17,719
Young Marshal.

42
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:28,039
I'll go eavesdrop for you.

43
00:04:14,816 --> 00:04:16,704
(Tomb of Revered Master Rong Huaiqiu)

44
00:04:20,959 --> 00:04:22,240
A master for a day,

45
00:04:22,519 --> 00:04:23,720
a grace for a lifetime.

46
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:28,879
Mr. Rong, do you want us
to dig up your ancestral grave?

47
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:40,240
Come on. Dig it up for me.

48
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:51,399
(Master, I hope you can forgive me.)

49
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:00,480
Mr. Rong,

50
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:03,759
open the box and let us check it out.

51
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:24,800
Mr. Du, how do you know

52
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:29,199
there are explosives in this box?

53
00:05:32,639 --> 00:05:34,600
A bunch of cowards afraid to die.

54
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:50,240
(Master,)

55
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:52,600
(I'm unfilial.)

56
00:05:53,319 --> 00:05:55,000
(But now I have no other choice.)

57
00:05:56,160 --> 00:06:00,120
(I only hope you watch over Xu You'an
and Chun'er and let them live on.)

58
00:06:01,759 --> 00:06:04,959
(To live on is hope.)

59
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:23,279
We have felt your sincerity, Mr. Rong.

60
00:06:23,639 --> 00:06:25,079
Let's talk back at the chamber.

61
00:06:37,839 --> 00:06:40,040
I can't believe you betrayed me

62
00:06:41,519 --> 00:06:43,160
and betrayed everyone.

63
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:47,439
If it weren't to save you,

64
00:06:47,439 --> 00:06:49,160
Yongnian wouldn't have died tragically.

65
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:53,079
But to save your own life,

66
00:06:54,839 --> 00:06:56,720
you defected and became a traitor.

67
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:05,639
(Tomb of Revered Master Rong Huaiqiu)
Rong Xiaonan,

68
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:09,439
I would rather Zhuzi had died
eight years ago.

69
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:25,600
And you are not him.

70
00:07:36,759 --> 00:07:38,240
Sir, a steamed bun.

71
00:07:38,519 --> 00:07:39,519
A fried dough stick.

72
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:42,480
Miss Jiang.

73
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:46,120
Thank goodness I came in time.

74
00:07:46,399 --> 00:07:49,040
Xu Fan's back in Governor Mansion
and has retaken military control.

75
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:51,160
He's put a city-wide bounty
on Xu You'an's head.

76
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:52,199
You must not go.

77
00:07:52,199 --> 00:07:53,240
How could this happen?

78
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:55,800
No, I have to save him.

79
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:59,199
Miss, it's very dangerous
outside right now.

80
00:07:59,199 --> 00:08:01,199
Let's go back to the mansion
and plan carefully.

81
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:03,079
Alright. Let's go.

82
00:08:08,319 --> 00:08:09,120
What should I do?

83
00:08:10,759 --> 00:08:13,879
Xu You'an has martial arts skills.
He'll surely be fine.

84
00:08:14,439 --> 00:08:16,600
No, I have to find a way to help him.

85
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:18,839
The reward is a full hundred gold.

86
00:08:18,959 --> 00:08:20,720
A handsome reward makes a brave man.

87
00:08:20,879 --> 00:08:23,079
Miss, you're still engaged to him.

88
00:08:23,279 --> 00:08:25,959
Will it implicate our Jiang family?

89
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:29,959
Hong'er, without him,
I would have been executed long ago.

90
00:08:30,399 --> 00:08:33,080
Once the Jiang family falls,
we're just like driftwood in the chaos.

91
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:34,639
He is our lifesaver.

92
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:37,159
How can you not be grateful
but fear being implicated?

93
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:39,399
You may leave.

94
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:44,240
Are you alright?

95
00:08:44,559 --> 00:08:45,600
Hurry, guard the door.

96
00:08:53,519 --> 00:08:54,320
Come on.

97
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:58,480
Xu Fan has put
a city-wide bounty on your life.

98
00:08:58,720 --> 00:08:59,799
What should we do?

99
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:04,559
To prevent Xu Fan
and the Xiaosheng Society from uniting,

100
00:09:05,399 --> 00:09:06,960
we must first take out Xu Fan.

101
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:12,200
Otherwise, Xu Fan's next target
will be the Jiang family.

102
00:09:12,799 --> 00:09:13,759
Where is Mr. Rong?

103
00:09:13,879 --> 00:09:15,200
Didn't you go to save him?

104
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:16,320
Why didn't he come back?

105
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:24,559
To live, Rong Xiaonan surrendered
to the Xiaosheng Society.

106
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:28,759
From now on,

107
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:33,440
he has nothing to do with us anymore.

108
00:09:34,159 --> 00:09:36,120
He wouldn't.
He's not that kind of person.

109
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:37,440
I saw it with my own eyes.

110
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:39,919
He led Du Xiaolin to dig up

111
00:09:39,919 --> 00:09:41,320
Rongqing Troupe's memorial tomb.

112
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:48,000
He handed your mother's phoenix crown
straight to the Xiaosheng Society.

113
00:09:48,799 --> 00:09:51,879
Impossible. He must have his reasons.

114
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:53,240
Where is he?

115
00:09:53,799 --> 00:09:56,360
He's now an honored guest to Du Xiaolin.

116
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,519
He's at the Xiaosheng Society.

117
00:10:00,928 --> 00:10:02,320
(Xiaosheng Society)

118
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:03,120
Mr. Rong.

119
00:10:15,720 --> 00:10:16,872
Why exactly did you do that?

120
00:10:18,039 --> 00:10:19,720
Miss Jiang, do you want to ask me

121
00:10:21,519 --> 00:10:24,919
why I can come and go
from the Xiaosheng Society unscathed

122
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:28,320
and why I can command
the Xiaosheng Society's people?

123
00:10:28,559 --> 00:10:29,960
Of course, it's to save my life.

124
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:32,840
By offering the kingfisher phoenix crown

125
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:34,759
and pledging allegiance to Mr. Du,

126
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:36,960
I can finally be someone of standing.

127
00:10:37,159 --> 00:10:38,440
Otherwise, who would save me?

128
00:10:39,399 --> 00:10:41,919
You, the nominal president
of the Chamber of Commerce?

129
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:46,480
Or Governor Xu, who lost his power
and became a stray dog?

130
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:52,600
Rong Xiaonan, you are heartless!

131
00:10:55,360 --> 00:10:57,440
Miss Jiang, if you have time
to accuse me,

132
00:10:57,919 --> 00:11:01,960
you'd be better off thinking
about how to save your family's legacy.

133
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:04,279
Those who conspire with the devil
will only meet their end.

134
00:11:05,039 --> 00:11:07,559
Aren't you afraid they'll turn on you
once they've used you up?

135
00:11:11,639 --> 00:11:17,159
Then Miss Jiang, you and Governor Xu
must protect yourselves well

136
00:11:18,159 --> 00:11:23,519
and make sure you live long enough
to see me die.

137
00:11:42,304 --> 00:11:43,584
♪As if it were fate♪

138
00:11:43,584 --> 00:11:44,941
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

139
00:11:45,503 --> 00:11:48,740
♪We miss each other♪

140
00:11:49,984 --> 00:11:51,552
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

141
00:11:51,552 --> 00:11:53,952
♪And a bizarre♪

142
00:11:53,952 --> 00:11:56,754
♪Anonymous legend♪

143
00:11:57,284 --> 00:11:59,296
♪The plot twists and turns♪

144
00:11:59,444 --> 00:12:01,184
♪Play out over and over again♪

145
00:12:01,184 --> 00:12:04,248
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

146
00:12:04,829 --> 00:12:06,528
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

147
00:12:06,528 --> 00:12:07,520
♪Refuse to submit♪

148
00:12:07,520 --> 00:12:10,720
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

149
00:12:12,384 --> 00:12:15,296
♪There are always too many♪

150
00:12:15,296 --> 00:12:17,184
♪Helpless situations♪

151
00:12:17,184 --> 00:12:19,808
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

152
00:12:20,939 --> 00:12:22,899
♪Even if I have questions♪

153
00:12:22,899 --> 00:12:24,899
♪I harbor desires♪

154
00:12:24,899 --> 00:12:27,776
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

155
00:12:28,127 --> 00:12:29,760
♪People come and go♪

156
00:12:29,760 --> 00:12:32,576
♪I'm still all alone♪

157
00:12:32,576 --> 00:12:35,304
♪Wandering around♪

158
00:12:35,552 --> 00:12:38,405
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

159
00:12:38,405 --> 00:12:42,866
♪Go through the entanglement♪

160
00:12:43,232 --> 00:12:44,960
♪If longing♪

161
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:48,119
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

162
00:12:48,119 --> 00:12:50,874
♪How can I be at ease♪

163
00:12:50,976 --> 00:12:53,290
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

164
00:12:53,408 --> 00:12:55,264
♪And travelled around the world♪

165
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:58,448
♪Scars all over me♪

166
00:12:58,720 --> 00:13:01,632
♪If longing never fades♪

167
00:13:01,632 --> 00:13:03,081
♪Burns still hot♪

168
00:13:03,081 --> 00:13:06,160
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

169
00:13:06,432 --> 00:13:08,289
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

170
00:13:08,352 --> 00:13:09,536
♪In the next life♪

171
00:13:09,536 --> 00:13:14,016
♪Entangle with you again♪
